              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create a template that can be used to send wires.\n\nAll monetary values are represented in minor units, or the smallest unit of the currency with no decimal (e.g., cents). For example, $10.00 is represented as 1000.\n\n\n\n<i>How can we improve these docs?             <a href=\"mailto:docs+feedback@narmi.com\">Share your feedback.</a></i>"
        },
