          "docs": "Delete a specified template belonging to the user. The template will continue to exist in the database, but won't be retrievable by the user. The name of the deleted template will be available for use in creating a new template.\n\nAll monetary values are represented in minor units, or the smallest unit of the currency with no decimal (e.g., cents). For example, $10.00 is represented as 1000.\n\n\n\n<i>How can we improve these docs?             <a href=\"mailto:docs+feedback@narmi.com\">Share your feedb"
